  "description": {
    "text": "The Gym Official events of January and February 2007 ran the Trade Please DP corner (とりかえっこDP) of that winter's 25th Next Generation World Hobby Fair: visitors swapped a Pokémon card of their own for one of eight Diamond & Pearl promos, Turtwig, Chimchar, Piplup, Pachirisu, Mime Jr., Staravia, Buneary and Glameow (017 to 024/DP-P), without choosing which. The same cards were prizes in the events' knockout battles and lotteries."
  },
